# Practices upstream snapshots — COMMITTED as of 2026-07-14 (P2-18): they are the
# offline quote-truth substrate for evidence_quote_spotcheck_guard [74] full-strict.
# Previously ignored as "regenerable via fetch.sh", but un-committed bodies made [74]
# unable to verify quote truth offline (advisory-only). Note: bodies are PUBLIC-doc
# text and may contain false-positive secret-LIKE patterns (e.g. Algolia public search
# keys in doc-site chrome) — private_boundary_guard does not scan practices/upstream
# (by design; these are third-party public docs, not our code).

# node_modules anywhere (eslint-plugin-ax, future tooling)
node_modules/

# practices-react snapshots are SMALL (1-5KB), HAND-CURATED quote sets,
# and serve as the evidence-anchor audit trail — track them, do NOT ignore.
.omx/

# /ax-fork-receiver bundle output (regenerable via skills/ax-fork-receiver/scripts/bundle.sh)
dist/

# R25 verify-completion audit log (machine-local, regenerated on every
# `bash practices/scripts/verify-completion.sh` run). The 49th hard guard
# (completion_checklist_recency_guard.sh) reads this file from local disk.
# Anchor to repo root so fixture .ax-verify/ dirs (test data) remain tracked.
/.ax-verify/
.crawl-21st/

# Playwright MCP browser-verification artifacts — screenshots + a11y/page snapshots from
# manual /showcase render checks. Kept locally for review, never committed (binary test output).
.playwright-mcp/
/persona-*.jpeg
/showcase-hub.png

# ax-ledger — per-project usage/violation trace (machine-local, per fork-receiver). Reviewable via
# practices/scripts/ax-ledger-review.sh; never committed (it is the local project's own history).
.ax-ledger/

# downstream_release_recency_guard.sh [114]'s audit log (machine-local, written by
# practices/scripts/verify-downstream.sh). Anchor to repo root so fixture .ax-downstream/ dirs
# (test data under practices/evals/fixtures/downstream_release_recency/) remain tracked.
/.ax-downstream/
